DESCRIPTION:This post contains affiliate links. We earn a commission if you
	 purchase tickets through our links at no extra cost to you. \nOfficial Ti
	ckets\nResale Tickets\nChazz Hawkins LIVE at Punch Line Comedy Club – Sacr
	amento\nGet ready for a hilarious night as Chazz Hawkins takes the stage a
	t Punch Line Comedy Club in Sacramento! Known for his sharp wit and relata
	ble storytelling\, Chazz delivers a high-energy stand-up performance you w
	on’t want to miss. \nEvent Details\nDate: Sunday\, August 2\, 2026\nTime: 
	7:00 PM (Doors open at 6:00 PM)\nVenue: Punch Line Comedy Club – Sacrament
	o\nAddress: 2100 Arden Way\, Sacramento\, CA 95825\nAge Requirement: 18+ w
	ith valid government-issued photo ID\nBeverage Minimum: 2 beverages per pe
	rson \nAbout Chazz Hawkins\nChazz Hawkins is a rising stand-up comedian kn
	own for his energetic performances and sharp observational humor. He has b
	een making waves on the comedy circuit with his unique perspective on ever
	yday life\, earning fans across the country with his authentic and hilario
	us storytelling style. \nWhat to Expect\n\nHigh-energy stand-up comedy per
	formance\nSharp observational humor and relatable storytelling\nIntimate c
	lub atmosphere at one of Sacramento’s premier comedy venues\nFull bar serv
	ice with 2-beverage minimum\nAn unforgettable night of laughs\n\nVenue Inf
	ormation\nPunch Line Comedy Club – Sacramento is located at 2100 Arden Way
	 in Sacramento\, CA. One of the top comedy clubs in Northern California\, 
	it features a full bar\, great sightlines\, and ample free parking in the 
	shopping center lot. \nTicket Information\nTickets start from $39. This is
	 an 18+ event with a 2-beverage minimum per person. Tickets are available 
	through Ticketmaster (official) or VividSeats (resale). \nOfficial Tickets
	\nResale Tickets\nThis post contains affiliate links. We earn a commission
