SUMMARY:Comedian Affion Crockett at Houston Improv
DTSTAMP:20260802T054431Z
DTSTART:20260808T213000Z
DESCRIPTION:Houston Improv welcomes Comedian Affion Crockett at Houston Imp
	rov for 6 shows over 4 nights on the Spring Branch stage. \nDebuting on HB
	O’s Def Comedy Jam\, the actor\, writer\, dancer\, and comic has gained ov
	er 50 million views on YouTube for his online sketch and parody videos. \n
	Admission\nTickets start at $37. Order tickets or learn more. \n \n\nThis 
	Featured Calendar Listing was sponsored by the event organizer and boosted
	 in our calendar with images and more details.  \nLearn more about promoti
	ng your event\, organization\, business\, or offer across all of our chann
