SUMMARY:Brookwood Casserole Delivery Day Memorial East Area - Aug. 28
DTSTAMP:20260802T054432Z
DTSTART:20260828T170000Z
DESCRIPTION:Dinner Solved. Mission Served!\nPick up frozen Brookwood casser
	oles in your neighborhood.\n\nPURCHASE YOURS TODAY for Brookwood Casserole
	 Delivery Days – Memorial East Pickup!\nPre-order now and pick up Friday\,
	 August 28 | 5:00–6:30pm📍 Second Baptist Church\, Woodway Campus – 6400 Wo
	odway Drive • Houston \n\nOur Citizens at The Brookwood Community™ know Au
	gust can feel like a marathon of carpools\, college move-ins\, and teacher
	 meet-and-greets. That’s why we’re making life easier—and more delicious—w
	ith Brookwood Casserole Delivery Days! \n✅ Three delicious frozen casserol
	es to choose from✅ Pre-order online\, then swing by and pick up on your wa
	y home✅ Serve 2–4 people – perfect for busy weeknights✅ Support adults wit
	h disabilities who live and work with purpose at Brookwood \n\n🍴 Your Cass
	erole Lineup:\n🥘 Beef & Spinach LasagnaSeasoned beef\, ricotta\, mushrooms
	\, basil\, and penne pasta layered into savory perfection. \n🌮 Fiesta Chic
	ken EnchiladaRoasted chicken\, sweet corn\, black beans\, queso fresco\, L
	atin-style red sauce\, and cheese between layers of corn tortillas. \n🐔 Ki
	ng Ranch Chicken – we brought back a Brookwood FAVORITE!Texas comfort clas
	sic made with tender chicken\, tomatoes\, green chiles\, layered tortillas
	\, and creamy cheesy goodness in every bite. \n\n💵 $35 each | Bulk Order D
	iscounts:\n\nBuy 5+ and save 5% with code: 5CASS\nBuy 10+ and save 10% wit
	h code: 10CASS\n\n\nDinner made easy. Purpose made powerful.Thank you for 
	helping change the way the world thinks about adults with disabilities. \n
	🗓️ Want to know where we’ll be next?Visit our Events Calendar for the full 
	schedule of Brookwood Casserole Delivery Days! \n \n\nhttps://brookwoodcom
	munity.org/event/brookwood-casserole-delivery-day-memorial-east-area-aug-2
	8/\n\nFrom Nutcracker Market
URL:https://brookwoodcommunity.org/event/brookwood-casserole-delivery-day-m
	emorial-east-area-aug-28/
LOCATION:Memorial Drive United Methodist Church\, 12955 Memorial Drive\, Ho
	uston\, TX\, 77079\, United States
X-CALRIPPER-SOURCE:nutcracker-market
CATEGORIES:Nutcracker Market
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
DURATION:PT2H
END:VEVENT
